ther user's team members"}, {"id": "backlog_moveset_default_main", "label": "Trap: missing moveset field falls back to main", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "sorgente_moveset() defaults to main; a copy of MA got 80 Incineroar moves instead of 77. Creation now writes it explicitly and save rejects unknown sources"}, {"id": "backlog_solo_pokemon_gaming_tradotte", "label": "Only Pokemon and Gaming sections are translated (sezioni_tradotte)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Language is a site-wide cookie; confined button and Italian shell are the same decision so a user in EN can always return. desc fields stay Italian by choice (1584 descriptions)"}, {"id": "backlog_file_storici_fallback", "label": "Historical data files kept as fallback until final collaudo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pokemon_catalog.json, roster_ma.json, moves_ma.json, items_ma.json, abilities.json remain as fallback; pokemon_catalog.json still has Mega in old converted form"}, {"id": "backlog_ordine_21_08", "label": "Work order decided 21/08/2026 (online last; Pokemon first from 14/09)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backlog_1_1_dati_proprietario", "label": "1.1 Data ownership (user_id, 78/78 queries)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backlog_1_2_editor_solo_admin", "label": "1.2 Pokemon editors admin-only (30/36 routes)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backlog_1_3_aggiungere_dati_webapp", "label": "1.3 Add data from the web app (PokeAPI species import)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Import recognizes entries by slug not key, forms don't pass through it, and re-importing must copy forms; validation rejects wrong types with 400 but saves missing fields as declared drafts"}, {"id": "backlog_1_4_export_completo", "label": "1.4 Full DB export (--completo mode)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "hub_export.json is committed so excludes passwords; a real backup needs a --completo mode writing outside the repo and refusing versioned folders. regulations table omitted by accident; theme in localStorage and language cookie are not in DB"}, {"id": "backlog_1_5_app_online", "label": "1.5 Put the app online (PythonAnywhere free / Cloudflare tunnel)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Constraints: user data always persisted and free; excludes Railway/Render/Fly. Real problem is 20 points writing files on disk at runtime. Security holes closed 21/08: debugger via HUB_DEBUG, SECRET_KEY file, no admin123 on login, requirements, wsgi.py"}, {"id": "backlog_1_6_due_guide", "label": "1.6 Two guides: architecture and new-PC restore", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "BACKLOG.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five partly contradictory docs with two version numbers; guide 1 